--[[
    Clean Roblox Studio menu (GUI only)
    Place this LocalScript in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts.
    This creates a draggable menu with harmless placeholder tabs:
    Visual, Cosmetics, Shaders, Radio, Themes, Utilities.

    Aim, WH/ESP, Movement and Animations are intentionally not included.
    This script does not modify gameplay, inspect other players, or provide exploits.
]]

